1result.sql
```

The query in 1result.sql fulfils every stated requirement while staying simplest and self‑contained:

• It filters orders, users, and inventory items to 2021 with clear inclusive/exclusive ranges.  
• Profit is calculated directly from the denormalised retail_price and cost columns already present in INVENTORY_ITEMS, avoiding an unnecessary join to PRODUCTS (as in 0result.sql) and any risk of mismatched prices.  
• It groups by month (formatted YYYY‑MM), country, product department, and product category, then counts orders and distinct purchasers exactly as requested.  

2result.sql is also close, but adds an extra DATE_TRUNC/TO_CHAR layer and relies on positional GROUP BY references, making it slightly less straightforward.